OL,3,CWindrush campaigner: #100,000 Jason
OL,4,CArday fundraiser shows 'Britain still
OL,5,Ccares'
OL,7,FA Windrush campaigner who launched a
OL,8,Ffundraiser for Professor Jason Arday's
OL,9,Ffamily which has topped #100,000 said
OL,10,Fthe outpouring of support shows
OL,11,F"Britain still cares".
OL,13,FProf Arday, who was found dead on
OL,14,FFriday, resigned from his post as
OL,15,Fprofessor of sociology of education at
OL,16,Fthe University of Cambridge last week
OL,17,Fafter allegations of plagiarism were
OL,18,Fmade against him.
OL,26,@sD@AOUsD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786929479
OL,3,CWindrush campaigner: #100,000 Jason
OL,4,CArday fundraiser shows 'Britain still
OL,5,Ccares'
OL,7,FA vigil for the professor, organised
OL,8,Fby the group Stand Up To Racism, will
OL,9,Fbe held on the steps of the National
OL,10,FGallery in Trafalgar Square, central
OL,11,FLondon, at 6pm on Monday.
OL,13,FOn Saturday, Sir Patrick Vernon, who
OL,14,Fplayed a leading role in the
OL,15,Fsuccessful campaign to establish a
OL,16,Fnational Windrush Day, set up a
OL,17,FGoFundMe crowdfunding page, which has
OL,18,Fcollected thousands of donations.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786929479
OL,3,CWindrush campaigner: #100,000 Jason
OL,4,CArday fundraiser shows 'Britain still
OL,5,Ccares'
OL,7,FHe told the Press Association the
OL,8,Foutpouring of support shows that the
OL,9,Fpublic "still cares" and feels "angry".
OL,11,FSir Patrick said: "Britain still cares
OL,12,F` people, black, white, brown, care
OL,13,Fand feel angry about the situation.
OL,15,F"People want to support the family.
OL,16,FThere's lots of speculation about how
OL,17,Fmuch money Jason has or doesn't have,
OL,18,Fthat's not the point.
OL,26,@qD@HOUqD@TO]qD@`OUqD@fO]sD@SOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786929479
OL,3,CWindrush campaigner: #100,000 Jason
OL,4,CArday fundraiser shows 'Britain still
OL,5,Ccares'
OL,7,F"The fact is, people want to support
OL,8,Fthe family because he's dead, he's
OL,9,Fdied, and he has a young family.
OL,11,F"He has parents and he has a family
OL,12,Fthat he has supported, and people want
OL,13,Fto support the family."
OL,15,FSir Patrick was one of several public
OL,16,Ffigures, including Green Party leader
OL,17,FZack Polanski and crossbench peer Lord
OL,18,FSimon Woolley, to sign an open letter
OL,19,Fsupporting Prof Arday as he faced
OL,20,Fmounting scrutiny from the press.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUuD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786929479
OL,3,CWindrush campaigner: #100,000 Jason
OL,4,CArday fundraiser shows 'Britain still
OL,5,Ccares'
OL,7,FHe told PA: "As someone in the public
OL,8,Feye myself, I've also been tapped by
OL,9,Fthe media for my campaigns and my
OL,10,Fviews and perspectives.
OL,12,F"Numerous people told the journalists
OL,13,Fthat he was vulnerable... Someone with
OL,14,Fautism, a neurodiverse background `
OL,15,Fthat was completely ignored, and he
OL,16,Fwas hounded, sadly, to his death.
OL,17,FTherefore, this has impacted his
OL,18,Ffamily.
OL,26,@oD@MOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786929479
OL,3,CWindrush campaigner: #100,000 Jason
OL,4,CArday fundraiser shows 'Britain still
OL,5,Ccares'
OL,7,F"And even now, as we speak, people are
OL,8,Fstill rubbishing Jason, even though
OL,9,Fhe's dead.
OL,11,F"He's not been buried yet, but people
OL,12,Fare still taking shots at him,
OL,13,Fsmearing him now. It's outrageous."
OL,15,FSir Patrick said the treatment of Prof
OL,16,FArday raises questions around press
OL,17,Fregulation, the University of
OL,18,FCambridge, and "the state of race
OL,19,Frelations in Britain today".
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUuD@cO]zD@POU{D@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
