PN,30607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786929479
OL,3,CWindrush campaigner: #100,000 Jason
OL,4,CArday fundraiser shows 'Britain still
OL,5,Ccares'
OL,7,FBefore Prof Arday's death, the
OL,8,Funiversity said it would investigate
OL,9,Fthe circumstances around his
OL,10,F"appointment and tenure", and the
OL,11,Ffindings would feed into a review of
OL,12,Fthe process for appointing senior
OL,13,Froles.
OL,15,FIt is understood the university does
OL,16,Fnot feel it is right to make a
OL,17,Fdecision on whether to proceed with
OL,18,Fits investigation while the
OL,19,Fprofessor's family are grieving.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
