FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786929479
OL,3,CWindrush campaigner: #100,000 Jason
OL,4,CArday fundraiser shows 'Britain still
OL,5,Ccares'
OL,7,FSir Patrick said the "appalling" way
OL,8,Fin which Prof Arday was treated
OL,9,Freflects the "higher standard" to
OL,10,Fwhich black people, and those from
OL,11,Fminority ethnic backgrounds, are held.
OL,13,FHe said: "This applies across
OL,14,Fdifferent sectors, NHS, local
OL,15,Fgovernment, civil service, private
OL,16,Fsector, etc, where black people, and
OL,17,Falso minority ethnic people, are given
OL,18,Fa higher standard, a higher burden,
OL,19,Fwhen it comes to issues around
OL,20,Faccountability and when things go
OL,21,Fwrong.
OL,26,@oD@VOUoD@`O]qD@NOUqD@^O]uD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786929479
OL,3,CWindrush campaigner: #100,000 Jason
OL,4,CArday fundraiser shows 'Britain still
OL,5,Ccares'
OL,7,F"What that tells you is that we still
OL,8,Fhave structural racism, we still have
OL,9,Finequalities as well, and that's why a
OL,10,Flot of people are feeling angry about
OL,11,Fthis, because it's quite clear this
OL,12,Fwas completely unjust, the level of
OL,13,Fscrutiny."
OL,15,FIn a message to Prof Arday's family,
OL,16,FSir Patrick said: "We care for you, we
OL,17,Frespect you.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@JO]xD@SOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
